# k.faces/shards/miniavs-moustache: the variants of the slot `moustache` in the DiceBear style `miniavs`: features, and parts converted from the drawings (a primitive shape, a box in the frame of the face, a draw order, a colour name and the exact colour; points for polygons and lines).
